[32m+[m[32m### Question 12: Guess a random number generated by computer.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### 1. Input-Process-Output (IPO) Model[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Input | Process | Output |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| A fixed random target and repeated guesses | Compare guess with target; repeat while unequal | Higher, Lower, or Correct; attempt count |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### 2. Pseudocode[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mSTART[m
[32m+[m[32mtarget ← RANDOM_INTEGER(1, 100)[m
[32m+[m[32mattempts ← 0[m
[32m+[m[32mREPEAT[m
[32m+[m[32m    READ guess[m
[32m+[m[32m    IF guess < 1 OR guess > 100 THEN[m
[32m+[m[32m        DISPLAY "Enter 1–100"[m
[32m+[m[32m    ELSE[m
[32m+[m[32m        attempts ← attempts + 1[m
[32m+[m[32m        IF guess < target THEN[m
[32m+[m[32m            DISPLAY "Higher"[m
[32m+[m[32m        ELSE IF guess > target THEN[m
[32m+[m[32m            DISPLAY "Lower"[m
[32m+[m[32m        ELSE[m
[32m+[m[32m            DISPLAY "Correct", attempts[m
[32m+[m[32m        END IF[m
[32m+[m[32m    END IF[m
[32m+[m[32mUNTIL guess = target[m
[32m+[m[32mSTOP[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
